{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":32,"alongside":33,"kin":34,"engines":59,"usedOn":60,"sites":61,"crewed":65,"museums":66,"hero":67},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/chandra.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_sites":28,"tagline":13,"description":31},"chandra","Chandra X射线天文台","observatory","NASA","USA","TRW / Northrop Grumman","1999-07-23","ACTIVE","1981-2011","shuttle-and-mir","空间最尖锐的X射线图像","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Chandra X-ray Observatory — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chandra_X-ray_Observatory","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Chandra — NASA","https://chandra.harvard.edu/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Chandra discoveries archive","https://chandra.harvard.edu/about/","deep",[29],{"type":30,"site_id":3},"earth-object","NASA 的旗舰 X 射线天文台，自 1999 年以来投入使用。分辨率约比以往任何 X 射线望远镜高 25 倍，能够直接成像黑洞吸积盘、超新星遗迹以及穿过星系团的炽热气体。",[],[],[35,39,43,47,51,55],{"id":36,"name":37,"tagline":38},"spitzer","Spitzer空间望远镜","红外大天文台；16 年数据",{"id":40,"name":41,"tagline":42},"compton-gro","Compton Gamma Ray Observatory","NASA的四大观测站之一",{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"kepler","Kepler","发现了 2,700+ 颗系外行星",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"tess","TESS","全天系外行星凌星巡天",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"xmm-newton","XMM-Newton","ESA的旗舰X射线观测站",{"id":56,"name":57,"tagline":58},"hubble","Hubble空间望远镜","标志性可见光/紫外线空间望远镜；5 次维修任务",[],[],[62],{"type":30,"href":63,"name":4,"place":-1,"text":64},"/earth?id=chandra","NASA的X射线眼睛。其极端椭圆轨道从9,942 km到133,600 km——达到月球距离的三分之一。这使其远离地球辐射带，能进行长期、清晰的观测。可观测黑洞、中子星、超新星——光学望远镜看不到的剧烈高能宇宙。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/chandra/04.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
